				Philippine Coordinate Converter: PRS92 ↔ WGS84
			</h1>
			<p class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-mapa-ink/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
				Convert instantly between standard GPS coordinates (WGS84 Latitude & Longitude) and projected Philippine coordinates (PRS92 / UTM Zone 51N Easting & Northing). Designed for GIS analysts, civil engineers, researchers, and students.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Converter Card Interface -->
		<div class="bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm mb-16">
			<!-- Mode Toggle -->
			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-5 border-b border-mapa-contour/60 font-sans">
				<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-mapa-ink/70 uppercase tracking-wider">Conversion Mode:</span>
				<div class="inline-flex rounded-lg border border-mapa-contour bg-mapa-canvas p-1 text-xs">
					<button
						type="button"
						id="mode-wgs-to-prs"
						class="mode-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md font-medium transition-all bg-mapa-green text-white shadow-xs"
					>
						WGS84 (Lat/Long) → PRS92 / UTM 51N
					</button>
					<button
						type="button"
						id="mode-prs-to-wgs"
						class="mode-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md font-medium text-mapa-ink/80 hover:text-mapa-green transition-all"
					>
						PRS92 / UTM 51N → WGS84 (Lat/Long)
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Preset Landmarks -->
			<div class="mb-6 font-sans text-xs">
				<span class="text-mapa-ink/60 font-medium mr-2">Try landmark presets:</span>
				<div class="inline-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2 sm:mt-0">
					<button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour text-mapa-ink/80 hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors" data-lat="14.5826" data-lon="120.9787">
						Kilometer Zero, Luneta
					</button>
					<button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour text-mapa-ink/80 hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors" data-lat="10.3157" data-lon="123.8917">
						Cebu Provincial Capitol
					</button>
					<button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour text-mapa-ink/80 hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors" data-lat="7.0644" data-lon="125.6092">
						Davao City Hall
					</button>
					<button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour text-mapa-ink/80 hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors" data-lat="16.4137" data-lon="120.5960">
